WPX Hosting is an international web hosting provider with a rapidly growing customer base from all over the world. Founded in 2013 in Bulgaria, today we are close to 100 employees and we offer one of the best customer experience and support, along with high-quality and high-speed WordPress Hosting to clients.
Due to the rapid growth and expansion of the company we are looking for a PHP developer to help us upgrade, improve and enhance the customer experience of our website.
You will collaborate with the Marketing and Design team to bring to life new campaigns, promotions, and fresh looks to our main websites.
Work on upgrading and improving our current software platform;
Develop, deliver and maintain websites and applications
Write reusable, testable, and efficient code;
Work closely with other team members in a friendly atmosphere
Design and implement software independently;
2+ year of experience with PHP;
Experience with a RDMS like MySQL or PostgreSQL;
Knowledge of HTML, CSS, Ajax, JavaScript, JSON, XML
Experience with the version control system, Git;
Understanding of OOP and Design Pattern principles.
Experience with WordPress Development;
Experience with PHP Template Engine Smarty;
Experience with Bootstrap;
Knowledge of REST API;
Experience with Adobe Products or Figma;
Salary reviews every 6 months based on your results and experience;
Multisport card and Spotify Premium;
Courses for your personal and professional growth covered by us;
Annual team building and regular outings and events;
Additional Healthcare Insurance;
Work from anywhere opportunity;
Daily fresh fruits, drinks and Friday Pizza events;
and more...
